@startuml
title Wildlife Monitor — Current data model (authentication branch)
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Prisma / PostgreSQL" {
  class Sensor {
    +id: UUID <<generated>>
    +deviceId: String <<unique>>
    +name: String
    +createdAt: DateTime <<generated>>
  }

  class Deployment {
    +id: UUID <<generated>>
    +sensorId: UUID
    +name: String
    +parkName: String
    +latitude: Float
    +longitude: Float
    +installedAt: DateTime
    +createdAt: DateTime <<generated>>
  }

  class Detection {
    +id: UUID <<generated>>
    +eventId: UUID <<unique>>
    +deploymentId: UUID
    +capturedAt: DateTime
    +classificationStatus: ClassificationStatus
    +speciesLabel: String?
    +confidence: Float?
    +imageKey: String?
    +modelVersion: String
    +classifiedAt: DateTime
    +createdAt: DateTime <<generated>>
  }

  class User <<schema only; auth not wired>> {
    +id: UUID <<generated>>
    +name: String
    +surname: String
    +email: String <<unique>>
    +emailVerified: Boolean
    +role: Role
  }

  enum ClassificationStatus {
    IDENTIFIED
    UNKNOWN
    NO_ANIMAL
  }

  enum Role {
    DEVELOPER
    ADMINISTRATOR
  }
}

Sensor "1" -- "0..*" Deployment : has installation history
Deployment "1" -- "0..*" Detection : records captures
Detection --> ClassificationStatus
User --> Role

note right of User
  Present in the Prisma schema on this branch.
  Authentication behavior and relations are not
  represented in the live controllers yet.
end note

note bottom of Detection
  imageKey is metadata only in the current API.
  Upload and object storage are planned.
end note
@enduml
